 "name": "Ghost in the SQL Data",
 "steam_appid": 5072430,
 "required_age": 0,
 "is_free": false,
 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/71412f5347d2dfea4e20313696527a92.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/71412f5347d2dfea4e20313696527a92.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=485 /></span>Here is a case. Using SQL, dig through the call centre data and find out who called before the fire started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/9f85af0753d2d547399d8598aa1f58d8.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/9f85af0753d2d547399d8598aa1f58d8.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=695 /></span>Use SQL to explore the data, filter it, connect the pieces. The easy levels teach you the basics and the hard ones put you in the shoes of a real data forensic, meaning an investigator who works on data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/abba6805c510f722c65c7e69261316a1.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/abba6805c510f722c65c7e69261316a1.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Using the whiteboard system, you can build charts and leads, and make sense of every piece of the case in order to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/ffec3977387924fee7356120b696fd8a.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/ffec3977387924fee7356120b696fd8a.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=628 /></span>Two case campaigns are available right now: find out who set the school on fire by searching the call centre databases, and track down a criminal by watching how people move through the Paris metro.</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/71412f5347d2dfea4e20313696527a92.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/71412f5347d2dfea4e20313696527a92.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=485 /></span>Here is a case. Using SQL, dig through the call centre data and find out who called before the fire started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/9f85af0753d2d547399d8598aa1f58d8.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/9f85af0753d2d547399d8598aa1f58d8.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=695 /></span>Use SQL to explore the data, filter it, connect the pieces. The easy levels teach you the basics and the hard ones put you in the shoes of a real data forensic, meaning an investigator who works on data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/abba6805c510f722c65c7e69261316a1.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/abba6805c510f722c65c7e69261316a1.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Using the whiteboard system, you can build charts and leads, and make sense of every piece of the case in order to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras/ffec3977387924fee7356120b696fd8a.avif?t=1789068592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5072430/extras_big/ffec3977387924fee7356120b696fd8a.webp?t=1789068592 width=1560 height=628 /></span>Two case campaigns are available right now: find out who set the school on fire by searching the call centre databases, and track down a criminal by watching how people move through the Paris metro.</p>",
 "short_description": "Somebody reported the fire fourteen minutes before it started. Prove it in SQL by exploring the call centre data.",
 "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
